    ('logical', 'tool_assisted', 'build_authoring', 'naming_instructions', 'workflow.logical.common.build_authoring.inputs.naming_instructions', 'text', 'Effective Logical naming guidance. Use the saved Silver Project override when present, otherwise the existing Logical default. Advisory guidance; preserve saved identities. This is resolved before rendering and remains a Logical-local variable.', '"Use PascalCase for Logical entity, attribute, and relationship names. Identifier Attribute names end with ID, with both I and D uppercase."'::jsonb, 140),
    ('logical', 'tool_assisted', 'build_authoring', 'audit_columns', 'workflow.logical.common.build_authoring.inputs.audit_columns', 'json', 'Exact configured Silver audit-column template: schema_version and columns with semantic_name, data_type, nullable, definition. Null settings use shared defaults; an explicit empty columns array disables audits. Reserve effective names for framework Attributes; source/business fields need distinct names. Preserve the existingdeterministic backend projection and lock/conflict checks. The complete project includes required audit Attributes; do not invent physical sources for configured audit columns.', '{"schema_version":"1.0","columns":[{"semantic_name":"CreatedAt","data_type":"timestamp","nullable":false,"definition":"Time the target row was created."},{"semantic_name":"UpdatedAt","data_type":"timestamp","nullable":true,"definition":"Time the target row was last updated."}]}'::jsonb, 150),
