    ('dimensional', 'one_shot', 'build_authoring', 'naming_instructions', 'workflow.dimensional.common.build_authoring.inputs.naming_instructions', 'text', 'Effective Gold naming override, otherwise the Dimensional default: PascalCase names, Entity names starting with Dim, Fact or Bridge, and surrogate and foreign keys ending in Key. Preserve existing identities.', '"Use PascalCase for Dimensional entity and attribute names. Start each Entity name with its type: Dim for a Dimension, Fact for a Fact, Bridge for a Bridge (DimCustomer, FactSalesOrder, BridgeCustomerGroup). Surrogate and foreign key names end with Key."'::jsonb, 150),
    ('dimensional', 'one_shot', 'build_authoring', 'audit_columns', 'workflow.dimensional.common.build_authoring.inputs.audit_columns', 'json', 'Effective Gold audit template; blank settings resolve to shared audit defaults;an explicit empty columns array disables audits. Reserve effective names for framework Attributes; source/business fields need distinct names. Same schema_version/ordered columns layout as Logical audit settings. Each column has semantic_name, data_type, nullable, definition. Configured audit columns remain authoritative.', '{"schema_version":"1.0","columns":[{"semantic_name":"LoadedAt","data_type":"TIMESTAMP","nullable":false,"definition":"Warehouse load time."}]}'::jsonb, 160),
