    ('dimensional', 'one_shot', 'build_authoring', 'dimensional_entity_scd_type', 'workflow.dimensional.common.build_authoring.inputs.dimensional_entity_scd_type', 'json', 'Frozen Project policy for Dimension history, independent of Logical SCD. type_1 overwrites mutable descriptors ; type_2 preserves Dimension versions . Stable identity Attributes remain fixed. Null is unspecified: use evidenced per-Attribute behavior. Applies to Dimensions, not Fact or Bridge history. Backend projects surrogate/foreign keys and configured Type 2 effective/current columns. Do not invent business keys or source history; changing this setting does not migrate previously applied data.', '"type_2"'::jsonb, 190),
