    ('dimensional', 'tool_assisted', 'build_authoring', 'object_relationship_context', 'workflow.dimensional.common.build_authoring.inputs.object_relationship_context', 'json', 'Read-only physical support traced from active lineage of the selected Logical Entities/Attributes; it does not expand Dimensional authoring sources. Existing applied relationships touching each scoped physical Object. Incoming matches the to-Object; outgoing matches the from-Object. Include empty groups. Preserve endpoint, hypothesis, lifecycle, lock and recorded validation fields. Validation outcome and aggregate counts are saved evidence, not a fresh measurement; all-null validation fields mean unvalidated. An endpoint outside object_context is contextual only and does not become an eligible authoring source.', '[{"tenant_code":"GDS","system_code":"WAREHOUSE","connection_code":"MAIN","object_schema":"bronze","object_name":"Orders","incoming_relationships":[],"outgoing_relationships":[{"from_tenant_code":"GDS","from_system_code":"WAREHOUSE","from_connection_code":"MAIN","from_object_schema":"bronze","from_object_name":"Orders","to_tenant_code":"GDS","to_system_code":"WAREHOUSE","to_connection_code":"MAIN","to_object_schema":"bronze","to_object_name":"Customers","from_attribute_name":"customer_id","to_attribute_name":"customer_id","relationship_kind":"reference","inferred_cardinality":"many_to_one","analysis_result_status":"active","analysis_result_is_locked":false,"validation_policy_version":"1.0.0","validation_result":"supported","validation_source_non_null_count":20,"validation_source_distinct_count":10,"validation_target_non_null_count":10,"validation_target_distinct_count":10,"validation_source_missing_target_count":0,"validation_unused_target_count":0,"validation_duplicate_target_key_count":0}]}]'::jsonb, 90),
    ('dimensional', 'tool_assisted', 'build_authoring', 'context_records', 'workflow.dimensional.common.build_authoring.inputs.context_records', 'json', 'Active Context records whose Context Type applies to this workflow, from active groups in authorized Project/Source System scope, are reusable guidance. Each record has context_record_id (canonical UUID), context_group_name, context_type_name, context_text and nullable source_reference. The type classifies its purpose; context_text contains the requirement, decision, rule, convention or other guidance, including relevant exceptions and acceptance criteria. source_reference records provenance. Use UUIDs for Context support references. Context applicability does not prove physical source data or replace measured validation; preserve registered lineage and distinguish guidance from observed evidence.', '[{"context_record_id":"9bbdef91-d027-58a3-b22f-92ef90293cd0","context_group_name":"Sales analytics rules","context_type_name":"Business Requirement","context_text":"One fact row represents one governed order. OrderCount is one for that row. Sum counts orders only across compatible aggregation levels.","source_reference":null}]'::jsonb, 100),
    ('dimensional', 'tool_assisted', 'build_authoring', 'existing_entities', 'workflow.dimensional.common.build_authoring.inputs.existing_entities', 'json', 'Active Dimensional Entities already built from this area''s Logical Entities, saved or built by an earlier area of this run, with their Attributes and the Relationships touching them. Reuse and extend them; list a record in your answer only to change it.', '{"entities":[{"dimensional_entity_schema_name":"gold","dimensional_entity_name":"DimCustomer","dimensional_entity_definition":"One row per customer account.","dimensional_entity_type":"dimension","dimensional_fact_type":null,"dimensional_entity_grain_definition":null,"dimensional_entity_dependency_order":0,"dimensional_entity_is_active":true,"dimensional_entity_is_locked":false,"sources":[{"support_source_type":"logical_entity","source_logical_entity":{"logical_entity_schema_name":"silver","logical_entity_name":"Customer"},"rationale":null,"is_active":true,"is_locked":false}]},{"dimensional_entity_schema_name":"gold","dimensional_entity_name":"FactSalesOrder","dimensional_entity_definition":"One row per order.","dimensional_entity_type":"fact","dimensional_fact_type":"transaction","dimensional_entity_grain_definition":"One row per order_id.","dimensional_entity_dependency_order":1,"dimensional_entity_is_active":true,"dimensional_entity_is_locked":false,"sources":[{"support_source_type":"logical_entity","source_logical_entity":{"logical_entity_schema_name":"silver","logical_entity_name":"SalesOrder"},"rationale":null,"is_active":true,"is_locked":false}]}],"attributes":[{"dimensional_entity_schema_name":"gold","dimensional_entity_name":"DimCustomer","dimensional_attribute_name":"CustomerKey","dimensional_attribute_definition":"Surrogate key for DimCustomer.","dimensional_attribute_data_type":"BIGINT","dimensional_attribute_is_nullable":false,"dimensional_attribute_ordinal_position":1,"dimensional_attribute_is_natural_key":false,"dimensional_attribute_is_surrog